Third-party origin of some code

Parts of this skill extend code snippets published in "How to build motion design
studio with Opus 5.5 (Full-course)" by Movez (@0xMovez), an X article dated
2026-09-27: https://x.com/0xMovez/status/2104216919033192746

- assets/template/lib/motion.js keeps the article's spring, track, indicator,
  swapAlpha and loopT functions.
- scripts/render.mjs (workers and canvas capture), scripts/synth.mjs (voices and
  sends), scripts/inspect.sh and scripts/finalize.py extend the article's snippets.

The article states no licence for its snippets. The licence in LICENSE covers the
author's own work in this repository; it does not grant rights the snippet author
has not granted. See references/sources.md for the full list of sources.
